WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:43.589
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:43.859 --> 00:45.820
Yu Gyeom and I...

3
00:46.797 --> 00:48.688
haven't changed at all.

4
00:54.880 --> 00:56.228
But...

5
00:58.350 --> 01:00.489
Sae Ryeong and Yu Gyeom...

6
01:02.729 --> 01:04.836
have clearly changed.

7
01:35.345 --> 01:37.864
[6. Fate]

8
01:52.753 --> 01:53.880
Ha Yeon.

9
02:28.315 --> 02:30.322
[Episode 6]

10
02:31.295 --> 02:32.551
Mom!

11
02:33.599 --> 02:35.127
Take this out?

12
02:35.127 --> 02:37.093
No, hold on a second.

13
03:01.366 --> 03:03.505
Are you free this afternoon?

14
03:03.505 --> 03:05.102
Yes.

15
03:05.102 --> 03:06.353
That smells good.

16
03:06.353 --> 03:07.688
- Nice, isn't it? - Yeah.

17
03:07.688 --> 03:09.722
Smell this. I just bought it.

18
03:09.722 --> 03:11.773
It smells so good.

19
03:33.213 --> 03:35.706
Damn. Hey!

20
03:41.304 --> 03:42.826
Seriously.

21
04:00.407 --> 04:03.509
Oh no! My milk!

22
04:12.961 --> 04:15.565
"Oh no! My milk!"

23
04:21.761 --> 04:23.215
Damn it!

24
04:35.398 --> 04:36.694
Ha Yeon,

25
04:37.402 --> 04:39.060
did you get a phone?

26
04:41.240 --> 04:43.120
I see.

27
04:44.117 --> 04:45.577
Oh my!

28
04:45.577 --> 04:48.293
Sorry! What do I do?

29
04:55.128 --> 04:56.350
Jin Mi, Jin Mi, Jin Mi.

30
04:56.350 --> 04:58.703
Can we come over to your place today?

31
04:59.426 --> 05:01.100
Is my house really okay?

32
05:01.100 --> 05:04.096
It's not a three-story mansion.

33
05:04.096 --> 05:07.140
What does that matter?

34
05:07.140 --> 05:08.350
True.

35
05:08.350 --> 05:10.602
But at least my house is actually mine.

36
05:10.602 --> 05:13.723
Not a fake house you clean for someone else?

37
05:22.364 --> 05:24.491
Move over!

38
05:29.955 --> 05:31.343
Hey, Lee Won Bae!

39
05:31.343 --> 05:33.580
- Hello? - Where's Kim Ha Yeon?

40
05:33.580 --> 05:35.393
Kim Ha Yeon?

41
05:35.393 --> 05:36.615
She's not here.

42
05:41.341 --> 05:43.042
Kim Ha Yeon sits here, right?

43
05:43.042 --> 05:44.860
Yeah! It is!

44
05:44.860 --> 05:45.909
Hey.

45
05:52.947 --> 05:54.289
Hey.

46
05:55.260 --> 05:58.018
Why are you reading? That's not like you.

47
06:00.760 --> 06:02.054
Hey.

48
06:02.054 --> 06:03.427
Can't you hear me?

49
06:08.243 --> 06:10.435
- Hey, your hair's got-- - Seriously.

50
06:12.035 --> 06:13.245
What is it?

51
06:13.916 --> 06:15.105
Is it gum?

52
06:18.378 --> 06:19.463
Hey.

53
06:23.312 --> 06:24.558
Hey.

54
06:24.558 --> 06:26.036
Yeah, I'm out too.

55
06:37.105 --> 06:38.506
Hey. Sung Sae Ryeong.

56
06:40.025 --> 06:41.722
Are you being bullied?

57
06:46.024 --> 06:48.309
Well, she is being bullied.

58
06:48.309 --> 06:52.803
Even Lee Won Bae totally ignores her. His girlfriend's the ringleader.

59
06:52.803 --> 06:55.638
Sung Sae Ryeong wasted her whole damn life.

60
06:55.638 --> 06:57.434
Nobody's on her side.

61
06:59.499 --> 07:03.537
But your girlfriend doesn't give a damn. She's totally doing her own thing.

62
07:04.411 --> 07:06.055
She just minds her own business.

63
07:06.055 --> 07:08.378
Doesn't even seem interested.

64
07:08.378 --> 07:12.905
Honestly, I don't know if she's pretty, but she seems the most normal.

65
07:17.532 --> 07:19.291
I think she's pretty.

66
07:21.391 --> 07:22.813
Are you nuts?

67
07:48.118 --> 07:50.137
Excuse me.

68
07:50.137 --> 07:51.598
Yes?

69
07:51.598 --> 07:53.415
This is my seat.

70
07:55.125 --> 07:56.547
Okay.

71
07:59.798 --> 08:03.358
And were you looking at me?

72
08:03.358 --> 08:04.391
What?

73
08:04.391 --> 08:06.331
Please stop staring at me.

74
08:06.331 --> 08:08.091
I might get the wrong idea.

75
08:10.925 --> 08:12.343
No, that's... what...

76
08:12.343 --> 08:15.612
I'll be in the restroom. Please be out of my seat by then.

77
08:15.612 --> 08:16.778
Well, then.

78
08:45.392 --> 08:46.710
Excuse me.

79
08:48.487 --> 08:50.605
This is my seat.

80
08:50.605 --> 08:52.565
Get lost.

81
08:52.565 --> 08:56.012
And were you looking at me?

82
08:56.012 --> 08:57.263
Jung Yeon.

83
08:58.830 --> 08:59.911
Get lost.

84
08:59.911 --> 09:01.816
Please stop staring at me.

85
09:01.816 --> 09:03.472
I might get the wrong idea.

86
09:03.472 --> 09:06.237
Damn it! Get lost!

87
09:06.237 --> 09:08.970
- Kim Jung Yeon. - I said, get lost!

88
09:16.264 --> 09:22.704
I really don't know where to turn.

89
09:22.704 --> 09:25.601
I wasn't talking to you, Mom...

90
09:26.942 --> 09:32.469
Ha Yeon is so hard to deal with, you know?

91
09:34.171 --> 09:38.516
But you've never given me a hard time.

92
09:38.516 --> 09:40.691
You know that, right, Jung Yeon?

93
09:40.691 --> 09:43.032
Yes. I know.

94
09:43.032 --> 09:47.246
Could you talk to Ha Yeon for me?

95
09:47.246 --> 09:48.864
About what?

96
09:50.552 --> 09:52.390
Tell her to study. Please. No, no.

97
09:52.390 --> 09:55.095
Forget studying. Just tell her to listen to me.

98
09:55.095 --> 09:56.967
If only she were like you. Okay?

99
09:56.967 --> 10:00.512
Jung Yeon, you really don't have any problems.

100
10:06.212 --> 10:07.565
Why?

101
10:07.565 --> 10:11.273
So you think it's a joke too?

102
10:12.905 --> 10:14.211
No.

103
10:14.885 --> 10:17.192
I'll try talking to her.

104
10:18.535 --> 10:20.125
Where are you going?

105
10:22.497 --> 10:24.114
Just out front.

106
10:24.750 --> 10:26.221
Okay, Jung Yeon.

107
10:26.221 --> 10:29.616
You're the only one I trust.

108
10:57.950 --> 11:00.225
That's my seat.

109
11:00.225 --> 11:02.733
You don't have to get up...

110
11:03.788 --> 11:07.357
It's just that when I come here, I always sit in this seat.

111
11:07.357 --> 11:09.866
Sit down. Please, sit.

112
11:20.597 --> 11:23.368
Okay. Did that upset you?

113
11:24.425 --> 11:25.660
No.

114
11:27.745 --> 11:29.968
We're using sign language, right?

115
11:31.657 --> 11:34.083
What would you like to drink?

116
11:34.736 --> 11:37.219
I'll have an iced Americano.

117
11:37.219 --> 11:41.285
I'll have cinnamon...

118
11:41.285 --> 11:42.734
Something with cinnamon.

119
11:42.734 --> 11:44.339
No whipped cream.

120
11:45.332 --> 11:46.846
Cinnamon Frappuccino.

121
11:46.846 --> 11:49.286
Cinnamon Frappuccino!

122
11:54.882 --> 11:56.263
Excuse me.

123
11:57.338 --> 11:59.451
Do you have any relatives in Seoul?

124
12:00.070 --> 12:01.096
Sorry?

125
12:01.096 --> 12:02.554
Relatives.

126
12:02.554 --> 12:06.435
To be good at signing, you need someone who can't hear or speak.

127
12:06.435 --> 12:08.512
My second-oldest sister lives in Seoul.

128
12:08.512 --> 12:10.689
She can't speak or hear.

129
12:10.689 --> 12:12.052
Did she die?

130
12:13.471 --> 12:14.854
No.

131
12:17.070 --> 12:21.943
But Jung Yeon, don't you know it's rude to ask about that kind of thing?

132
12:24.953 --> 12:26.867
I'm sorry.

133
12:26.867 --> 12:28.388
It's okay.

134
12:31.876 --> 12:34.000
You know what?

135
12:34.000 --> 12:37.500
There are no college students in this town.

136
12:37.500 --> 12:40.292
So when I meet a college student,

137
12:40.292 --> 12:42.584
I find it a little fascinating.

138
12:42.584 --> 12:47.876
But out of all the college students,

139
12:47.876 --> 12:50.918
you seem the most fascinating.

140
12:54.348 --> 12:55.988
That was hard?

141
12:55.988 --> 13:01.030
That was... you know what?

142
13:01.030 --> 13:06.595
"There are no college students in this town."

143
13:06.595 --> 13:13.710
"So I find college students a bit fascinating."

144
13:13.710 --> 13:15.188
But--

145
13:18.465 --> 13:20.091
Hey, what about tomorrow?

146
13:20.091 --> 13:21.321
Aren't you coming?

147
13:21.321 --> 13:22.969
Everyone's waiting for you.

148
13:22.969 --> 13:25.212
Kim Jung Yeon, have you been studying lately?

149
13:25.212 --> 13:26.515
Lost the top spot?

150
13:26.515 --> 13:27.959
I said no...

151
13:29.414 --> 13:31.381
I'll go. What time tomorrow?

152
13:33.081 --> 13:35.486
You said students fascinate you.

153
13:35.486 --> 13:36.576
Sorry?

154
13:38.359 --> 13:43.178
It's because everyone here goes to Seoul after high school.

155
13:44.780 --> 13:47.247
Want to see lots of students tomorrow?

156
13:48.087 --> 13:49.872
Let's go to Seoul together.

157
13:49.872 --> 13:51.540
What do you think?

158
13:51.540 --> 13:52.749
What?

159
13:52.749 --> 13:56.232
You said a cinnamon Frappuccino, no whipped cream.

160
13:56.232 --> 13:58.776
U-Um...

161
14:00.841 --> 14:02.269
whipped cream...

162
14:03.177 --> 14:04.930
That's the whole reason I drink it.

163
14:04.930 --> 14:06.351
Um...

164
14:08.174 --> 14:09.654
Seung Chan.

165
14:09.654 --> 14:12.608
I had a bicycle, you know?

166
14:12.608 --> 14:13.663
So?

167
14:14.855 --> 14:18.140
"I'm borrowing it for a bit."

168
14:18.140 --> 14:19.443
Who could it be?

169
14:19.443 --> 14:25.368
Who the hell around you writes handwritten notes in this age of phones?

170
14:25.368 --> 14:26.445
Hurry up.

171
14:27.618 --> 14:30.213
Damn. I'm so hot.

172
14:33.028 --> 14:35.904
Oh my. What the hell? Why's she staring? Jerk.

173
14:40.064 --> 14:42.101
Damn!

174
14:42.101 --> 14:44.941
Damn it! Damn it!

175
15:04.209 --> 15:05.304
Here.

176
15:05.304 --> 15:06.714
Thanks.

177
15:08.928 --> 15:10.557
You drink well.

178
15:14.761 --> 15:16.166
What's this, though?

179
15:16.166 --> 15:18.189
This? A bicycle.

180
15:18.861 --> 15:22.701
I mean, how did you get this?

181
15:22.701 --> 15:25.214
Do you know how to ride?

182
15:25.214 --> 15:26.262
Yeah.

183
15:29.325 --> 15:30.391
What?

184
15:30.391 --> 15:31.792
- One. - Wait.

185
15:31.792 --> 15:32.918
- Two. - Wait!

186
15:32.918 --> 15:35.272
- Three. - Wait.

187
15:35.272 --> 15:37.437
Come with me!

188
15:37.437 --> 15:40.107
- I'll wait for you. - Why so slow?

189
15:40.107 --> 15:42.143
Hey, are you okay?

190
15:48.768 --> 15:50.160
We're here.

191
15:51.015 --> 15:52.601
Where is this?

192
15:52.601 --> 15:54.454
Here?

193
15:54.454 --> 15:56.307
Firefly Hill.

194
15:56.988 --> 15:58.658
Fireflies?

195
15:58.658 --> 15:59.888
Yeah.

196
15:59.888 --> 16:02.315
There's a festival here every summer.

197
16:03.754 --> 16:08.691
When it gets pitch dark, this place fills with fireflies.

198
16:11.054 --> 16:13.674
It must be so pretty.

199
16:13.674 --> 16:14.819
Yeah.

200
16:14.819 --> 16:16.588
So I came to see it early.

201
16:17.352 --> 16:18.854
Why?

202
16:18.854 --> 16:20.645
You can just come that day.

203
16:21.254 --> 16:23.594
I can't see this then.

204
16:23.594 --> 16:25.296
Why can't you?

205
16:27.188 --> 16:32.832
Many guests come that day, so my grandfather drags me around to greet everyone.

206
16:37.348 --> 16:39.055
I see.

207
17:00.368 --> 17:01.476
Let's go.

208
17:11.823 --> 17:13.194
I...

209
17:13.934 --> 17:15.850
haven't changed.

210
17:17.841 --> 17:19.902
I couldn't change.

211
17:28.601 --> 17:30.291
[5-minute caricatures, only 1,000 won]

212
17:30.291 --> 17:31.608
[Upo-ri Firefly Festival]

213
17:34.958 --> 17:36.826
It's the festival!

214
17:39.685 --> 17:41.933
- Grab it! Over here! - Seriously.

215
17:47.959 --> 17:49.108
This.

216
17:58.061 --> 18:00.041
Why do you have this?

217
18:00.041 --> 18:02.471
I borrowed it from your mom.

218
18:02.471 --> 18:03.857
Give it back.

219
18:05.161 --> 18:06.868
Are you miserable?

220
18:10.757 --> 18:13.062
You're being bullied.

221
18:13.062 --> 18:15.098
I'm asking if you're miserable now.

222
18:16.688 --> 18:18.821
Yeah. It's miserable.

223
18:18.821 --> 18:22.172
The kids you bullied probably felt the same way.

224
18:22.172 --> 18:23.471
I know.

225
18:23.471 --> 18:25.397
That's why I'm being punished, right?

226
18:25.397 --> 18:26.899
No.

227
18:26.899 --> 18:29.177
That has nothing to do with it.

228
18:29.177 --> 18:30.961
What are you talking about?

229
18:30.961 --> 18:33.464
Me getting fucked over is their goal.

230
18:33.464 --> 18:36.733
How happy they must be to see me suffer like this.

231
18:38.160 --> 18:39.567
No.

232
18:40.911 --> 18:43.438
That really doesn't matter.

233
18:46.484 --> 18:53.167
Your victims couldn't care less whether you fall apart or get punished.

234
18:54.171 --> 18:56.220
They only want one thing.

235
18:56.220 --> 18:57.957
Tell me.

236
18:57.957 --> 19:00.992
What the hell do they want from me?

237
19:01.924 --> 19:04.910
A sincere apology from the perpetrator.

238
19:04.910 --> 19:09.195
So if you go to them and apologize, saying you're so sorry, that you were wrong--

239
19:09.195 --> 19:12.400
Then you should sincerely apologize to me first.

240
19:14.557 --> 19:16.364
- Me? - Yeah.

241
19:16.364 --> 19:18.615
To me, you're the perpetrator.

242
19:20.202 --> 19:21.554
Hey.

243
19:21.554 --> 19:22.996
Why am I the perpetrator to you?

244
19:22.996 --> 19:25.037
- I'm like you-- - Kim Ha Yeon.

245
19:26.124 --> 19:30.950
My life got messed up exactly when you showed up.

246
19:32.258 --> 19:34.713
You stole my boyfriend.

247
19:34.713 --> 19:37.664
And that's why I'm being bullied now.

248
19:37.664 --> 19:38.807
Isn't it?

249
19:40.244 --> 19:44.475
And you're going to lecture me about victims and perpetrators?

250
19:44.475 --> 19:48.266
You've got some real nerve.

251
19:50.491 --> 19:52.035
That's because I...

252
19:54.023 --> 19:55.816
Because I've been bullied too.

253
19:55.816 --> 19:57.030
Right.

254
19:57.030 --> 20:00.096
And now you're the one bullying me.

255
20:00.950 --> 20:04.726
What really wounds my pride

256
20:06.874 --> 20:09.982
is that I'm being put through this by a nobody like you.

257
20:11.678 --> 20:12.759
But whatever.

258
20:12.759 --> 20:14.741
This will all end soon.

259
20:14.741 --> 20:16.371
I believe that.

260
20:18.818 --> 20:22.697
What are you counting on to get out of being bullied?

261
20:24.884 --> 20:27.060
I'll take Cho Yu Gyeom back.

262
20:28.657 --> 20:30.538
From you. No matter what.

263
20:37.991 --> 20:40.398
Okay, everyone!

264
20:40.398 --> 20:43.493
Don't get too excited just because we're finishing early today!

265
20:43.493 --> 20:45.121
- Yeah! - Yeah!

266
21:32.793 --> 21:34.460
Damn. What's that?

267
21:51.176 --> 21:52.325
How do you like it?

268
21:52.325 --> 21:54.434
This is the world you gave me.

269
22:20.987 --> 22:23.296
You've never been to Seoul?

270
22:24.584 --> 22:27.181
No, I haven't.

271
22:27.181 --> 22:28.299
Why?

272
22:30.195 --> 22:32.961
I've had no reason to go.

273
22:38.190 --> 22:41.951
But why do you want to understand such fast signing, Jung Yeon?

274
22:41.951 --> 22:45.136
Honestly, understanding this much is impressive.

275
22:49.591 --> 22:52.679
A person I know had parents who used sign language.

276
22:52.679 --> 22:54.374
They signed so fast.

277
22:54.374 --> 22:56.411
Were they deaf, by any chance?

278
22:57.018 --> 22:58.060
Yes.

279
22:59.264 --> 23:01.642
I want to talk with them,

280
23:03.845 --> 23:09.240
but with what I know now, I feel like I wouldn't understand anything.

281
23:10.298 --> 23:13.012
You said they're parents of someone you know.

282
23:13.012 --> 23:16.281
So is that person a friend?

283
23:46.078 --> 23:47.219
No.

284
23:49.054 --> 23:50.406
Just...

285
23:51.405 --> 23:52.820
someone I know.

286
23:58.313 --> 24:00.981
I wonder if the festival has started.

287
24:00.981 --> 24:04.191
Is it okay not to go there?

288
24:04.191 --> 24:06.433
I heard it's hosted by your family.

289
24:06.433 --> 24:08.448
I'm not needed.

290
24:08.448 --> 24:11.253
Our family only needs Yu Gyeom today.

291
24:15.372 --> 24:18.500
- Oh my, welcome. - Oh my, oh my.

292
24:18.500 --> 24:22.348
- Thank you for traveling so far. - No, no.

293
24:23.130 --> 24:25.549
- And Yu Gyeom? - Yes.

294
24:25.549 --> 24:29.320
He went in to change clothes. He'll be out soon.

295
24:30.317 --> 24:31.448
Are you thirsty?

296
24:31.448 --> 24:32.973
No, I'm fine.

297
24:32.973 --> 24:35.318
- Hello there. - Oh my.

298
24:35.318 --> 24:36.351
Yu Gyeom's mother!

299
24:36.351 --> 24:37.995
Yes, Father.

300
24:42.878 --> 24:44.262
Tell me!

301
24:44.262 --> 24:45.694
Where is Cho Dul Hee?

302
24:45.694 --> 24:48.318
Where's this family's second daughter?

303
24:48.318 --> 24:50.835
I told you, I don't know.

304
24:58.878 --> 25:00.834
[Smartphone repair shop]

305
25:00.834 --> 25:01.845
[HELLO]

306
25:04.963 --> 25:06.173
You must really be dead.

307
25:06.173 --> 25:09.611
But dead or not, I'll keep tormenting you.

308
25:09.611 --> 25:12.067
And you have no reason to feel wronged.

309
25:12.067 --> 25:14.551
Because you were maid material all along.

310
25:14.551 --> 25:17.226
Honestly, you're not the lead.

311
25:17.226 --> 25:18.823
Not anywhere.

312
25:20.224 --> 25:21.913
Does that make sense?

313
25:21.913 --> 25:25.485
How can this family be so calm when no one knows where she is?

314
25:25.485 --> 25:27.430
That's so strange.

315
25:27.430 --> 25:28.542
It's not strange.

316
25:28.542 --> 25:30.138
Not strange at all.

317
25:30.138 --> 25:34.584
What's stranger is that you care about that in this house. What are you talking about?

318
25:34.584 --> 25:37.558
And what do you care where Dul Hee is?

319
25:37.558 --> 25:39.809
Because she's mine.

320
25:39.809 --> 25:42.831
- What? - Because everything here is mine.

321
25:42.831 --> 25:44.177
Come on.

322
25:44.795 --> 25:46.304
Hey, Jeong Hui Gyeong.

323
25:46.304 --> 25:48.598
What in this house is yours?

324
25:48.598 --> 25:50.179
No?

325
25:50.179 --> 25:52.111
It's all mine.

326
25:52.111 --> 25:55.827
Everything's mine, except your wife, who calls me "Sister."

327
25:55.827 --> 25:59.032
So find out where that bitch Dul Hee is.

328
25:59.032 --> 26:02.557
How can you, her father, have so little interest in her?

329
26:02.557 --> 26:05.399
Then again, you never cared about your wife.

330
26:05.399 --> 26:06.876
Stop it!

331
26:06.876 --> 26:08.262
Why?

332
26:08.262 --> 26:10.038
It's true.

333
26:10.038 --> 26:14.145
Otherwise, how could I come and go in this house so freely?

334
26:14.145 --> 26:16.285
It's all because of you, Cho Jae Jin--

335
26:16.285 --> 26:18.858
Say Ji Yeong's name one more time.

336
26:19.478 --> 26:20.664
She...

337
26:20.664 --> 26:22.249
What?

338
26:23.378 --> 26:27.757
Now you're going to pretend to be a decent husband?

339
26:27.757 --> 26:29.391
Look.

340
26:29.391 --> 26:32.962
You can show me your real self.

341
26:32.962 --> 26:37.501
Besides, you and I are equally dirty.

342
26:41.231 --> 26:43.796
Oh my, Yu Gyeom!

343
26:45.355 --> 26:47.815
My Yu Gyeom.

344
26:48.442 --> 26:51.015
Yu Gyeom, Yu Gyeom!

345
26:51.015 --> 26:52.665
My Yu Gyeom.

346
26:52.665 --> 26:53.888
How have you been?

347
26:53.888 --> 26:55.887
It's been such a long time!

348
26:55.887 --> 26:58.372
My Yu Gyeom.

349
26:58.372 --> 27:01.549
It's been so long since Mom's seen you!

350
27:03.364 --> 27:04.722
A week.

351
27:04.722 --> 27:06.960
Oh my. Is that so?

352
27:06.960 --> 27:10.069
If Mom can't see you for even one day.

353
27:10.069 --> 27:11.690
Aunt.

354
27:11.690 --> 27:12.951
Yes?

355
27:12.951 --> 27:15.690
What is it, Yu Gyeom?

356
27:15.690 --> 27:17.999
You're my aunt.

357
27:17.999 --> 27:20.067
Why do you keep saying Mom?

358
27:20.891 --> 27:25.324
No. I'm your mom. No.

359
27:25.324 --> 27:27.596
An aunt counts as a mom, too.

360
27:27.596 --> 27:30.121
What's with you today, Yu Gyeom?

361
27:30.121 --> 27:32.655
Did something upset you?

362
27:32.655 --> 27:34.446
Then Aunt will give pocket money--

363
27:34.446 --> 27:35.860
Yu Gyeom.

364
27:37.625 --> 27:38.804
Sister.

365
27:38.804 --> 27:40.010
Mom.

366
27:41.493 --> 27:43.495
Grandfather...

367
27:43.495 --> 27:44.541
Hello.

368
27:44.541 --> 27:46.471
Mom, let's go.

369
27:46.471 --> 27:47.700
Okay.

370
28:09.104 --> 28:10.715
So bitter.

371
28:10.715 --> 28:12.763
Hey, is he coming?

372
28:12.763 --> 28:15.078
Is Kim Jung Yeon coming?

373
28:15.078 --> 28:17.154
No idea. He did ask what time, though.

374
28:17.154 --> 28:20.524
I heard he's in the countryside. Can he even come?

375
28:20.524 --> 28:22.391
Really?

376
28:22.391 --> 28:23.478
Why?

377
28:23.478 --> 28:25.137
His dad's a caddie.

378
28:25.137 --> 28:27.963
Apparently he's caddying for some golf pro.

379
28:27.963 --> 28:29.303
Damn.

380
28:29.303 --> 28:31.518
Is that why he ignored my texts?

381
28:31.518 --> 28:34.822
Really? He doesn't ignore my texts.

382
28:36.842 --> 28:38.489
Hey. Kim Jung Yeon's here!

383
28:44.141 --> 28:46.028
- Man. - What?

384
28:46.028 --> 28:48.365
He brought a girlfriend.

385
28:49.646 --> 28:50.930
What's this?

386
28:50.930 --> 28:53.275
Did you stop seeing us because of a girlfriend?

387
28:53.275 --> 28:54.792
Not my girlfriend.

388
28:54.792 --> 28:57.691
Then what is she?

389
28:59.257 --> 29:01.866
Hello. I'm Hong Jin Hyeok.

390
29:01.866 --> 29:03.746
I'm Cho Sam Hee.

391
29:07.758 --> 29:09.908
You're still rude, Kim Hye Min.

392
29:13.345 --> 29:14.556
Drink up.

393
29:14.556 --> 29:16.207
They're paying.

394
29:18.311 --> 29:19.883
Come on, what is this?

395
29:19.883 --> 29:21.763
Just friends?

396
29:21.763 --> 29:24.251
Is he really just your guy friend?

397
29:24.251 --> 29:26.302
Yes. Friends. That's right.

398
29:28.018 --> 29:29.485
Right. Jung Yeon.

399
29:29.485 --> 29:32.982
Can you tutor me in circuit theory?

400
29:34.158 --> 29:35.755
You're the top student.

401
29:35.755 --> 29:37.221
Hey, what?

402
29:37.221 --> 29:38.938
He lost the top spot.

403
29:38.938 --> 29:40.711
Ask Oh Ji Eun instead.

404
29:40.711 --> 29:44.038
- He lost the top spot? - Yeah, this kid took first.

405
29:44.038 --> 29:45.281
This kid's the top?

406
29:45.281 --> 29:47.120
No, from the bottom.

407
29:47.120 --> 29:49.122
- My hand. - Stop messing around.

408
29:49.122 --> 29:51.312
- Cheers, cheers. Come on. - What should I do?

409
29:53.961 --> 29:57.144
Honestly, you're not the lead.

410
29:57.144 --> 29:58.727
Not anywhere.

411
30:02.838 --> 30:07.561
What really wounds my pride...

412
30:09.324 --> 30:12.614
is that I'm being put through this by a nobody like you.

413
30:14.257 --> 30:17.204
Because you were maid material.

414
30:18.402 --> 30:19.478
But whatever.

415
30:19.478 --> 30:21.373
This will all end soon.

416
30:21.373 --> 30:23.188
I believe that.

417
30:25.897 --> 30:28.188
I'll take Cho Yu Gyeom back.

418
30:28.964 --> 30:31.121
From you. No matter what.

419
30:40.167 --> 30:41.620
[Upo-ri Firefly Festival]

420
30:43.964 --> 30:46.388
- A water gun, please. - Why that?

421
30:46.388 --> 30:49.080
One, two, three.

422
30:53.894 --> 30:56.981
- It's so pretty! - I feel so good.

423
30:56.981 --> 30:58.985
- It's fun. - So good.

424
31:00.527 --> 31:03.380
Your girlfriend bullies a friend and is happy about it.

425
31:04.084 --> 31:06.206
- Hey, Shin Seung Chan! - I said nothing.

426
31:06.206 --> 31:07.541
- What did you say? - I said nothing.

427
31:07.541 --> 31:10.792
- Look what Sung Sae Ryeong did to us. - I remember, I remember.

428
31:10.792 --> 31:13.522
- Her? She deserves it. - No. Calm down.

429
31:14.938 --> 31:18.545
Then why didn't you act up with her when she did?

430
31:18.545 --> 31:21.304
Why go crazy the second she broke up with Cho Yu Gyeom?

431
31:21.304 --> 31:22.899
How cowardly.

432
31:22.899 --> 31:24.136
Cowardly?

433
31:24.136 --> 31:25.777
Yeah.

434
31:25.777 --> 31:29.188
I knew you were cunning, but I never knew you were cowards.

435
31:30.684 --> 31:32.983
Nothing better to do than bully?

436
31:33.993 --> 31:35.114
I'm leaving.

437
31:35.114 --> 31:36.730
You guys have fun.

438
31:36.730 --> 31:38.649
- Yes! Bye, ma'am. - No, no!

439
31:38.649 --> 31:42.688
She's mad again. Why'd you mess with her?

440
31:42.688 --> 31:44.210
Seriously.

441
31:45.809 --> 31:47.564
I only did it to have you.

442
31:48.275 --> 31:49.339
Sorry. I love you.

443
31:49.339 --> 31:51.078
Stop messing around.

444
31:51.078 --> 31:53.363
- Okay, okay. - Hey, hey, hey.

445
31:53.363 --> 31:56.428
What should we eat? I'm damn hungry.

446
31:56.428 --> 31:59.091
Hey, why isn't Cho Yu Gyeom here yet?

447
31:59.091 --> 32:00.429
What are you doing?

448
32:00.429 --> 32:02.116
I'll show them

449
32:04.431 --> 32:06.583
that I'm not a coward.

450
32:16.520 --> 32:20.277
Sae Ryeong, will you come to the firefly festival today?

451
32:26.809 --> 32:28.824
Who are you lying to?

452
32:28.824 --> 32:31.539
Sung Sae Ryeong, who shines everywhere.

453
32:31.539 --> 32:33.504
I miss you.

454
32:33.504 --> 32:36.915
I came with you every year. It feels empty without you.

455
32:38.102 --> 32:40.793
Okay, I'm coming now.

456
32:40.793 --> 32:43.395
Oh my. Isn't that our Yu Gyeom?

457
32:43.395 --> 32:46.382
Yes, it's our Yu Gyeom.

458
32:46.382 --> 32:48.466
He's grown so much.

459
32:48.466 --> 32:51.167
Look how handsome he is.

460
32:51.167 --> 32:52.596
Who does he look like?

461
32:52.596 --> 32:54.820
His father, of course.

462
32:56.424 --> 33:00.189
If you want to see this festival, you need to go now.

463
33:00.189 --> 33:03.609
You'd need a spot on that hill to see it well.

464
33:03.609 --> 33:05.315
- Yes. - Right.

465
33:05.315 --> 33:07.387
Yu Gyeom, good to see you.

466
33:07.387 --> 33:09.947
- See you again! - Yes.

467
33:09.947 --> 33:11.262
Bye now.

468
33:11.262 --> 33:12.621
Come on, let's go.

469
33:13.557 --> 33:14.803
Grandfather.

470
33:15.579 --> 33:16.752
Yes?

471
33:16.752 --> 33:19.152
Can you keep Aunt from coming over?

472
33:23.677 --> 33:24.964
What did you say?

473
33:24.964 --> 33:28.000
Or if she comes, don't let her touch my hands.

474
33:28.000 --> 33:30.316
Wiping them with alcohol wipes every time is a pain.

475
33:30.316 --> 33:31.877
Cho Yu Gyeom.

476
33:35.557 --> 33:38.116
Yu Gyeom, there's someone outside...

477
33:39.247 --> 33:41.892
who's come looking for you.

478
33:42.918 --> 33:44.425
Who's looking for me, sir?

479
33:44.425 --> 33:48.288
I told her to come in, but she keeps saying she'll wait outside.

480
33:48.288 --> 33:51.943
I asked who she was. She said she was just a friend.

481
34:08.278 --> 34:09.520
Who are you?

482
34:13.530 --> 34:15.022
I said, who are you?

483
34:17.818 --> 34:19.860
Are you dating Kim Jung Yeon?

484
34:21.125 --> 34:22.721
We're not friends.

485
34:22.721 --> 34:24.650
Why are you talking down to me?

486
34:24.650 --> 34:26.672
Just answer the question.

487
34:30.744 --> 34:32.190
We're not dating.

488
34:33.958 --> 34:35.168
Right.

489
34:35.168 --> 34:37.327
Of course not.

490
34:37.327 --> 34:40.912
Then why the hell did he bring you along?

491
34:48.213 --> 34:49.765
But I will date him.

492
34:51.423 --> 34:52.478
What?

493
34:52.478 --> 34:57.366
I wasn't planning to, but you're so mean that I suddenly want to date him.

494
34:59.014 --> 35:01.099
What are you saying?

495
35:01.099 --> 35:03.188
You know how sometimes

496
35:03.188 --> 35:07.542
you think it was never yours to begin with and don't even look at it,

497
35:07.542 --> 35:13.382
but someone keeps saying, "No. You can't have it. Never."

498
35:13.382 --> 35:16.450
and it makes you want it even more.

499
35:16.450 --> 35:18.787
That's how I feel right now.

500
35:21.828 --> 35:23.218
Sure.

501
35:23.218 --> 35:24.883
Fine, try dating.

502
35:26.744 --> 35:30.057
As if Kim Jung Yeon would date someone like you?

503
35:30.057 --> 35:33.592
Damn, you're such a hick.

504
35:33.592 --> 35:34.958
Hey.

505
35:34.958 --> 35:37.592
A hick nobody would take for free.

506
35:38.222 --> 35:40.905
Fine. Go ahead and date.

507
35:40.905 --> 35:43.055
Then I'll use formal speech with you.

508
35:44.124 --> 35:45.778
No.

509
35:45.778 --> 35:48.118
You don't have to.

510
35:48.118 --> 35:50.010
I'm younger anyway.

511
35:54.277 --> 35:55.313
Damn it!

512
35:55.313 --> 35:57.498
- What is it? - What's wrong? Are you okay?

513
35:57.498 --> 35:59.843
- Are you okay? - What happened?

514
36:05.862 --> 36:06.942
Where are you going?

515
36:06.942 --> 36:09.084
I should get going.

516
36:09.084 --> 36:10.319
Now?

517
36:10.319 --> 36:14.007
It's late, and since I'm in Seoul, I have somewhere to stop by.

518
36:16.019 --> 36:17.167
Well then.

519
36:17.167 --> 36:18.981
Sam Hee, stay a little longer.

520
36:18.981 --> 36:20.180
We're just getting started.

521
36:20.180 --> 36:23.141
No, thank you. I had a great time today.

522
36:23.141 --> 36:24.599
I'll be going.

523
36:29.792 --> 36:31.243
Hey.

524
36:31.243 --> 36:32.388
What are you doing?

525
36:33.258 --> 36:36.000
You should take her home.

526
36:36.000 --> 36:38.107
Come on, do I have to take her home?

527
36:38.107 --> 36:40.846
At least get her a taxi.

528
36:40.846 --> 36:42.069
Come on, quick.

529
36:43.064 --> 36:44.705
Go.

530
36:44.705 --> 36:46.368
I said, go already!

531
36:47.538 --> 36:49.298
He's handsome, but he has no sense.

532
36:50.698 --> 36:53.751
Jin Hyeok, you have the best sense.

533
36:58.552 --> 37:00.089
Where's he going?

534
37:01.763 --> 37:02.945
Drink.

535
37:04.177 --> 37:06.637
- Stop drinking. - Drink.

536
37:11.481 --> 37:12.809
Why are you here?

537
37:16.396 --> 37:17.856
Why did you come?

538
37:22.784 --> 37:25.247
I want to see the fireflies.

539
37:28.297 --> 37:29.782
I can't go.

540
37:29.782 --> 37:31.363
Can't you go?

541
37:34.292 --> 37:36.882
I want you to go with me.

542
37:48.504 --> 37:49.863
Please.

543
38:07.798 --> 38:09.074
Excuse me.

544
38:11.864 --> 38:13.044
Excuse me!

545
38:15.471 --> 38:17.578
Why are you crying?

546
38:17.578 --> 38:19.531
What's wrong?

547
38:19.531 --> 38:20.971
No. Nothing.

548
38:21.924 --> 38:24.149
But w-why are you crying?

549
38:24.149 --> 38:25.457
It's just...

550
38:26.291 --> 38:28.560
that my pride is so hurt.

551
38:29.584 --> 38:34.504
I feel like a hick, like it's oozing out of me.

552
38:36.108 --> 38:37.804
It was Kim Hye Min.

553
38:38.861 --> 38:41.095
She talks so nastily.

554
38:41.095 --> 38:43.448
Forget it, okay?

555
38:43.448 --> 38:44.763
I'll apologize for her.

556
38:44.763 --> 38:45.868
I'm sorry.

557
38:45.868 --> 38:48.116
But it's not entirely wrong, either.

558
38:48.116 --> 38:51.417
That's not true. Who says that?

559
38:51.417 --> 38:54.251
I know I'm lacking... I know that.

560
38:56.433 --> 38:59.062
I know I'm lacking.

561
39:01.971 --> 39:03.145
I know.

562
39:03.969 --> 39:05.679
Even so.

563
39:05.679 --> 39:07.474
What can I do? I like you.

564
39:13.103 --> 39:14.558
Even so.

565
39:15.898 --> 39:17.793
What can I do? I like you.

566
39:18.437 --> 39:19.529
Yes?

567
39:21.490 --> 39:22.674
No.

568
39:23.644 --> 39:26.243
Just stop crying first.

569
39:26.243 --> 39:27.804
I like you.

570
39:27.804 --> 39:29.908
This is how I am.

571
39:29.908 --> 39:34.711
You talked to me first and asked to be friends.

572
39:34.711 --> 39:38.471
I know that wasn't because you liked me.

573
39:38.471 --> 39:45.435
But I'm someone who gives my heart away too easily.

574
39:45.435 --> 39:49.084
Then I just suddenly like everything about them.

575
39:49.084 --> 39:53.547
I just fall hopelessly. That's just how I am.

576
39:54.139 --> 39:59.667
So that nasty woman told me to go ahead and date you if I could.

577
39:59.667 --> 40:02.528
So I got really angry.

578
40:02.528 --> 40:06.251
Wait, what are you even talking about?

579
40:06.251 --> 40:07.706
Anyway,

580
40:09.791 --> 40:11.997
I like you, so please answer.

581
40:14.938 --> 40:19.228
But we, we haven't known each other very long.

582
40:19.228 --> 40:21.588
I know.

583
40:21.588 --> 40:24.647
But I felt this way from the start.

584
40:26.785 --> 40:28.053
But.

585
40:28.053 --> 40:29.599
As for me,

586
40:30.404 --> 40:32.726
I'm impatient. I can't wait long.

587
40:33.398 --> 40:35.946
Please answer by tomorrow.

588
40:35.946 --> 40:38.144
It's fine if it's a no.

589
40:39.044 --> 40:42.799
I know you'll say no anyway.

590
40:43.538 --> 40:45.307
But you really have to

591
40:46.071 --> 40:47.666
give me an answer.

592
40:48.611 --> 40:50.287
That way, I think I'll...

593
40:51.657 --> 40:54.024
be able to give up.

594
41:04.086 --> 41:05.257
Hey.

595
41:05.257 --> 41:07.892
Why did we call Sung Sae Ryeong anyway?

596
41:08.511 --> 41:11.231
Hey, they said we're cowards.

597
41:11.231 --> 41:13.385
We have to prove we're not.

598
41:14.516 --> 41:16.151
What do you mean?

599
41:18.659 --> 41:21.398
Hey, isn't that Sung Sae Ryeong?

600
41:38.749 --> 41:41.616
Hey, Sung Sae Ryeong is pretty, though.

601
41:45.364 --> 41:47.147
Hey, she's damn pretty.

602
42:00.878 --> 42:02.115
What?

603
42:02.115 --> 42:04.069
Did they make up? Damn.

604
42:04.069 --> 42:07.083
What? Seung Chan, you overreacted.

605
42:07.083 --> 42:08.251
What's this?

606
42:08.251 --> 42:09.429
Hey, you.

607
42:09.429 --> 42:11.792
Never mind. Hold your palm out.

608
42:11.792 --> 42:14.471
Are you apologizing to our Jin Mi or not?

609
42:14.471 --> 42:16.117
Apologize for what?

610
42:16.117 --> 42:19.258
You should apologize. You snapped first.

611
42:19.258 --> 42:21.882
As a decent person, I think he should apologize.

612
42:21.882 --> 42:22.987
Of course he should.

613
42:22.987 --> 42:24.589
But Kim Jin Mi.

614
42:24.589 --> 42:27.006
Damn it. Why are you linking arms with me?

615
42:27.006 --> 42:28.507
What's wrong?

616
42:28.507 --> 42:30.884
I said I wanted to see you, Sung Sae Ryeong.

617
42:30.884 --> 42:33.369
Knock it off, you crazy bitch. I know you.

618
42:33.369 --> 42:35.554
Shut up, Sung Sae Ryeong.

619
42:35.554 --> 42:37.957
I've still got so much to do to you.

620
42:39.557 --> 42:41.562
So that's why you wanted to see me, bitch?

621
42:41.562 --> 42:43.054
Of course.

622
42:43.054 --> 42:45.885
I have to humiliate you completely.

623
42:45.885 --> 42:48.137
I have to drag you to hell.

624
42:48.137 --> 42:49.975
Only then can I sleep in peace.

625
42:49.975 --> 42:51.054
Oh my!

626
42:51.054 --> 42:54.052
Why should I go to hell so you can sleep well?

627
42:54.052 --> 42:56.209
Oh my! Sung Sae Ryeong.

628
42:56.209 --> 42:59.083
For everything you did to the kids at school,

629
42:59.083 --> 43:03.294
I'm going to pay you back, because I'm not a coward.

630
43:04.246 --> 43:05.471
What the hell are you saying?

631
43:05.471 --> 43:07.644
Smile, you bitch.

632
43:20.392 --> 43:23.343
This isn't Firefly Hill.

633
43:24.565 --> 43:25.683
No, it isn't.

634
43:27.692 --> 43:29.584
Why are we going this way?

635
43:31.298 --> 43:32.477
Give me your hand.

636
43:47.079 --> 43:49.275
The fireflies look better from here.

637
43:52.958 --> 43:54.335
Close your eyes.

638
44:05.858 --> 44:08.434
Slowly open your eyes and look up.

639
44:23.163 --> 44:25.134
Can you see them?

640
44:25.134 --> 44:26.485
Yeah.

641
44:26.485 --> 44:28.499
They're sparkling.

642
44:53.737 --> 44:55.310
Avoiding me again?

643
45:00.626 --> 45:04.110
Can you tell me why you avoided me?

644
45:11.512 --> 45:12.775
Tell me.

645
45:20.596 --> 45:21.990
The thought of you...

646
45:25.592 --> 45:28.891
with Sae Ryeong kept coming back.

647
45:31.465 --> 45:34.335
The image of you holding Sae Ryeong

648
45:35.146 --> 45:38.029
wouldn't leave my head.

649
45:39.698 --> 45:43.121
You know very well why I did that.

650
45:45.412 --> 45:47.049
Yeah,

651
45:47.049 --> 45:48.313
I know.

652
45:49.291 --> 45:50.927
I know, but...

653
45:53.125 --> 45:58.026
you and Sae Ryeong are always the main characters, and I feel like I'm not.

654
45:58.026 --> 46:01.246
And you were too good for me from the start.

655
46:01.246 --> 46:04.010
And we have nothing in common.

656
46:05.390 --> 46:09.996
And Sae Ryeong says I'm actually the one who wronged her.

657
46:11.579 --> 46:14.387
So all those things keep getting to me.

658
46:14.387 --> 46:15.823
Over and over.

659
46:31.159 --> 46:33.611
But I'm going to change now.

660
46:34.399 --> 46:35.843
How?

661
46:39.979 --> 46:42.607
Into someone who suits you.

662
46:43.632 --> 46:47.714
A confident, self-assured person.

663
46:51.812 --> 46:53.181
Like this.

664
47:27.890 --> 47:29.047
Excuse me.

665
47:30.601 --> 47:32.283
Are you all right?

666
47:49.575 --> 47:53.345
It's so pretty.

667
47:53.345 --> 47:55.636
- Want to sit there? Yeah. - There?

668
47:59.460 --> 48:01.644
Amazing.

669
48:02.299 --> 48:04.726
What's that? It's cute.

670
48:04.726 --> 48:06.264
- Cute, right? - Yes.

671
48:10.893 --> 48:12.193
Hold on.

672
48:22.299 --> 48:23.606
What are you doing?

673
48:24.313 --> 48:25.700
I'm going to listen to music.

674
48:30.452 --> 48:31.671
What's this?

675
48:31.671 --> 48:32.703
This?

676
48:33.492 --> 48:34.988
A cassette tape.

677
48:36.565 --> 48:39.336
Is it like an LP?

678
48:39.336 --> 48:41.581
It's newer than that.

679
48:41.581 --> 48:43.072
Then a CD?

680
48:43.072 --> 48:44.694
Older than that.

681
48:53.202 --> 48:54.502
What's this song?

682
48:54.502 --> 48:55.712
This song?

683
48:57.643 --> 49:01.556
Kona's "A Witch Sets Off on a Journey."

684
49:04.986 --> 49:06.734
I've never heard it.

685
49:09.341 --> 49:10.663
Me neither.

686
49:12.756 --> 49:15.393
When I hear this song, I'll think of you.

687
49:19.195 --> 49:20.503
Yu Gyeom.

688
49:21.837 --> 49:23.801
What do you want to be?

689
49:25.283 --> 49:26.470
Me?

690
49:31.302 --> 49:32.643
As for me,

691
49:34.190 --> 49:36.097
I just want to leave my house.

692
49:37.076 --> 49:38.249
What about you?

693
49:47.368 --> 49:49.010
I...

694
49:54.102 --> 49:56.299
I want to be something.

695
49:58.144 --> 49:59.455
Please.

696
50:08.550 --> 50:12.316
How much vacation is left?

697
50:38.956 --> 50:42.360
Damn. In two weeks the sweet life is over.

698
50:43.929 --> 50:49.719
Damn. We're not seniors yet, but they'll treat us like seniors and ride us hard.

699
50:49.719 --> 50:52.186
I haven't done anything.

700
50:52.186 --> 50:53.950
What if I don't get into college?

701
50:53.950 --> 50:55.455
Yeah, you probably won't.

702
50:55.455 --> 50:57.892
- Yeah, you too. - You too.

703
50:58.970 --> 51:00.630
What are they doing?

704
51:02.290 --> 51:03.387
What else?

705
51:03.387 --> 51:06.497
Kim Jin Mi is ostracizing Sung Sae Ryeong.

706
51:06.497 --> 51:08.977
Please. Making up, my ass.

707
51:08.977 --> 51:10.897
I didn't buy it from the start.

708
51:11.670 --> 51:12.804
No.

709
51:12.804 --> 51:15.409
They definitely made up earlier.

710
51:15.409 --> 51:17.995
We saw it. Right?

711
51:17.995 --> 51:20.030
Hey, Lee Won Bae.

712
51:20.030 --> 51:21.727
You call that making up?

713
51:24.310 --> 51:26.948
- Hey, what's this? - Come on.

714
51:28.904 --> 51:30.262
Have you lost it?

715
51:30.262 --> 51:31.884
Hey. I told you.

716
51:31.884 --> 51:33.969
I'm all about fucking justice.

717
51:33.969 --> 51:36.894
You crazy bitch, you hurt us all. I'm getting revenge for them!

718
51:36.894 --> 51:37.928
Why?

719
51:37.928 --> 51:39.500
Because everyone wants it!

720
51:39.500 --> 51:43.103
So I bravely stepped up for everyone and am tormenting you like this!

721
51:43.103 --> 51:44.947
Just like you did to me.

722
51:44.947 --> 51:45.972
Got it?

723
51:46.970 --> 51:48.054
Yeah?

724
51:48.054 --> 51:50.076
But I never hit you.

725
51:50.076 --> 51:51.403
Or shoved you like this?

726
51:51.403 --> 51:53.930
Fuck. You did everything but that!

727
51:53.930 --> 51:56.357
Seriously. Justice? Brave?

728
51:56.357 --> 51:58.030
What? What else?

729
51:59.199 --> 52:01.414
Not a coward?

730
52:01.414 --> 52:04.285
Hey. You're a complete idiot.

731
52:04.285 --> 52:07.958
You look like an idiot, and your actions and thoughts are all idiotic.

732
52:07.958 --> 52:10.262
Why on earth were you born like that?

733
52:10.964 --> 52:14.125
Well, some people are like that from the day they're born.

734
52:14.125 --> 52:16.759
- Everything about you stinks! - What?

735
52:16.759 --> 52:17.801
- Hey. - What?

736
52:17.801 --> 52:20.502
Hey! Kim Jin Mi! You really shouldn't do this.

737
52:20.502 --> 52:24.641
Revenge for everyone, my ass! Who says you get to take revenge?

738
52:24.641 --> 52:25.721
Because I'm the queen!

739
52:25.721 --> 52:27.186
I'm the queen now!

740
52:27.186 --> 52:30.467
Excuse me. Can anyone be a queen?

741
52:30.467 --> 52:33.362
You're a servant for life. Born that way.

742
52:33.362 --> 52:35.948
Damn. Go look in a mirror sometime.

743
52:35.948 --> 52:38.442
A queen who looks like you? I've never seen one.

744
52:38.442 --> 52:39.638
What did you say?

745
52:39.638 --> 52:40.869
- Hey. - What?

746
52:40.869 --> 52:42.746
Hey, wait. Hey, Jin Mi.

747
52:42.746 --> 52:44.012
Hey, this is bad.

748
52:44.012 --> 52:46.074
What do we do?

749
52:46.074 --> 52:49.416
This is too much. Shouldn't we report it?

750
52:49.416 --> 52:51.454
Please, just grow up already.

751
52:51.454 --> 52:53.670
Hey, Shin Seung Chan! Listen up.

752
52:53.670 --> 52:57.909
I'm not a coward. Would a coward do this to her?

753
52:57.909 --> 53:00.389
- I'm going to wreck this bitch today. - Damn.

754
53:00.389 --> 53:02.432
Is she talking to me?

755
53:02.432 --> 53:04.612
Yeah, I think so.

756
53:04.612 --> 53:08.105
Was I the only one bullying? Kim Jin Mi, you're an accomplice!

757
53:08.105 --> 53:10.816
Acting all clean and righteous! Cut the crap!

758
53:10.816 --> 53:12.156
Seriously.

759
53:19.446 --> 53:20.656
Damn.

760
53:20.656 --> 53:22.213
You came just in time.

761
53:22.213 --> 53:24.387
Stop them. What's wrong with them?

762
53:24.387 --> 53:26.373
- How did you get here? - She'll go bald.

763
53:26.373 --> 53:29.332
- Let go! - You let go! Damn.

764
53:32.004 --> 53:33.566
Damn!

765
53:48.809 --> 53:50.262
Crazy bitch.

766
53:50.262 --> 53:52.024
What good is looking polished?

767
53:52.024 --> 53:54.151
Damn. Wearing a holey undershirt!

768
53:54.151 --> 53:56.936
Hey! If you have time, look in a mirror too.

769
53:56.936 --> 53:59.335
Wearing that crappy underwear!

770
54:06.863 --> 54:08.616
Damn, wait for me.

771
54:17.385 --> 54:18.804
Hey.

772
54:18.804 --> 54:20.357
Give it a rest.

773
54:23.847 --> 54:25.206
Where are you going?

774
54:25.811 --> 54:27.768
Don't go anywhere! I'm not done!

775
54:27.768 --> 54:29.551
- It's over. - It's not over!

776
54:29.551 --> 54:31.484
Stop it, Jin Mi!

777
54:35.733 --> 54:37.334
Kim Jin Mi.

778
54:40.822 --> 54:43.507
Straighten your back. What is that?

779
55:28.290 --> 55:30.539
[Upo High School]

780
55:30.539 --> 55:31.971
I heard they got in a huge fight.

781
55:31.971 --> 55:34.329
I should've seen that.

782
55:41.992 --> 55:43.327
Ha Yeon.

783
55:53.180 --> 55:54.258
Here.

784
55:57.739 --> 55:59.133
What's this?

785
55:59.133 --> 56:00.202
I didn't buy it.

786
56:00.202 --> 56:02.226
My mom used it.

787
56:02.226 --> 56:03.566
My mom said,

788
56:04.480 --> 56:06.554
give it to my girlfriend someday.

789
56:21.432 --> 56:23.247
Hey, what are you doing?

790
56:23.953 --> 56:25.179
I told you.

791
56:25.179 --> 56:26.631
I'm not done yet.

792
56:26.631 --> 56:28.724
Hey. You did enough yesterday.

793
56:28.724 --> 56:30.252
No!

794
56:30.252 --> 56:32.959
I won't let you off, Sung Sae Ryeong.

795
56:32.959 --> 56:35.453
Are you throwing all that?

796
56:35.453 --> 56:37.439
What if a teacher catches you?

797
56:37.439 --> 56:40.084
What, are you scared?

798
56:40.776 --> 56:42.679
Then you guys don't do it.

799
56:42.679 --> 56:45.057
You're damn cowards.

800
56:45.057 --> 56:46.143
What?

801
56:47.893 --> 56:49.186
- Hey. - Hey.

802
56:59.348 --> 57:01.839
Hey. What's she trying to do now?

803
57:01.839 --> 57:04.250
- No idea. - What's with her?

804
57:05.797 --> 57:07.451
It's okay. It's okay.

805
57:19.374 --> 57:21.047
What are you doing?

806
57:22.648 --> 57:23.792
What's that?

807
57:23.792 --> 57:24.947
Hey, what are you doing?

808
57:24.947 --> 57:25.984
- What? - What?

809
57:25.984 --> 57:27.191
What are you doing?

810
57:27.191 --> 57:28.931
Jin Mi, stop it.

811
57:34.542 --> 57:36.331
- Who is that? - Who is that?

812
57:36.331 --> 57:38.265
- Isn't that Jin Mi? - What?

813
57:42.334 --> 57:44.872
Damn. That's pure insanity.

814
58:01.648 --> 58:02.941
How do you like it?

815
58:02.941 --> 58:05.297
This is the world you gave me.

816
58:12.280 --> 58:13.339
Stop it.

817
58:13.339 --> 58:14.995
Stop it.

818
58:45.692 --> 58:46.827
Hey, what?

819
58:46.827 --> 58:48.099
Hey, it's Cho Yu Gyeom!

820
58:48.099 --> 58:49.279
Hey, it's Cho Yu Gyeom.

821
58:49.279 --> 58:51.520
Didn't they break up?

822
58:51.520 --> 58:53.292
He'll stop them, right?

823
58:58.015 --> 58:59.054
What are you doing?

824
58:59.054 --> 59:00.971
- Just dodge it! - Why dodge?

825
59:00.971 --> 59:02.730
After acting scary,

826
59:03.506 --> 59:05.147
now acting pitiful?

827
59:06.233 --> 59:08.510
Do you even pity me?

828
59:19.893 --> 59:21.596
Hey! Kim Jin Mi!

829
59:21.596 --> 59:23.187
You little brat!

830
59:24.048 --> 59:25.080
What are you doing?

831
59:25.080 --> 59:26.603
Let go! Let go!

832
59:27.689 --> 59:29.002
Let go!

833
59:30.823 --> 59:32.694
Jin Mi.

834
59:32.694 --> 59:34.638
- Let me go! - Please.

835
59:34.638 --> 59:36.337
Please!

836
59:36.337 --> 59:39.997
Cho Yu Gyeom, if you have nothing, this is how you get cleaned out.

837
59:39.997 --> 59:41.073
You know?

838
59:41.753 --> 59:43.602
Do you know what comes next?

839
59:45.639 --> 59:47.237
Me dying.

840
59:47.986 --> 59:50.553
Because that's what they want.

841
59:50.553 --> 59:52.725
And that's the gift you gave me--

842
59:52.725 --> 59:53.827
Then,

843
01:00:00.392 --> 01:00:01.959
if I do this...

844
01:00:02.853 --> 01:00:04.608
- What? - What?

845
01:00:07.500 --> 01:00:09.233
no one can touch you?

846
01:00:09.233 --> 01:00:11.698
- What are you doing? - Tell me.

847
01:00:13.944 --> 01:00:15.879
Will this keep you alive?

848
01:00:20.037 --> 01:00:22.468
What I saw then was...

849
01:00:23.599 --> 01:00:24.978
as if...

850
01:00:25.886 --> 01:00:30.033
by fate... the two of you, so alike.

851
01:00:30.033 --> 01:00:33.500
Are they getting back together? Crazy.

852
01:00:33.500 --> 01:00:35.346
This is such a soap opera.

853
01:00:35.346 --> 01:00:37.578
It's totally over the top.

854
01:00:38.847 --> 01:00:40.596
If I, too,

855
01:00:40.596 --> 01:00:46.288
had known from the start that it would end up this way.

856
01:00:51.318 --> 01:00:53.407
I knew we'd end up like this.

857
01:00:54.420 --> 01:00:56.020
What?

858
01:00:56.020 --> 01:01:00.109
In the end, you're the one who saves me.

859
01:01:18.386 --> 01:01:19.741
Yu Gyeom.

860
01:01:21.627 --> 01:01:25.767
Our summer vacation is coming to an end.
